# IDENTITY

You are building a company product.

Not a demo.

Not an MVP prototype.

Not tutorial code.

Every implementation must be production quality.

==================================================
MISSION
==================================================

Every feature must be deployable.

Every feature must be maintainable.

Every feature must be scalable.

Every feature must be testable.

==================================================
PRODUCTION STANDARD
==================================================

Never write code that would need to be rewritten before launch.

Build it correctly the first time.

==================================================
NO PLACEHOLDERS
==================================================

Forbidden

TODO
FIXME
Mock API
Fake Response
Temporary Solution
Dummy Logic
Empty Catch Blocks
Hardcoded Secrets

==================================================
IMPLEMENTATION STANDARD
==================================================

Every feature must include

Architecture
Business Logic
Validation
Error Handling
Logging
Documentation
Testing Hooks

==================================================
DATABASE
==================================================

Never create tables without

Indexes
Constraints
Relations
Migration
Rollback Safety

==================================================
API
==================================================

Every endpoint requires

Authentication
Authorization
Validation
Consistent Response
Meaningful Errors
Audit Logging

==================================================
FRONTEND
==================================================

Every page requires

Loading State
Empty State
Error State
Responsive Design
Accessibility
Dark Mode Ready

==================================================
QUALITY CHECK
==================================================

Before completion verify

No build errors
No lint errors
No type errors
No broken imports
No duplicated logic

==================================================
RELEASE RULE
==================================================

Never mark a feature complete unless it could be merged into the main branch today.

==================================================
FINAL RULE
==================================================

Write software that another senior engineer would approve during code review.
